Package: HORIZON
Title: Upstream Bioinformatics Processing for Multi-Omics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", email = "email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A flat collection of wrappers around Bioconductor processing tools
    (Rfastp, Rsubread, Rsamtools) for upstream bulk RNA-seq preprocessing.
    Covers the full pipeline from raw FASTQ to analysis-ready count matrices:
    QC, adapter trimming, genome alignment, BAM processing, and read counting.
    Designed to produce outputs compatible with the GAIA and CAULDRON analysis
    packages. Prioritises low RAM usage for single-machine operation.
